<p align="center" style="margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:center"><span lang="VI" style="font-size:10.0pt">0,027 · </span><i><span style="font-size:
  10.0pt">p<sub>t</sub></span></i><sup><span lang="VI" style="font-size:10.0pt">0</span></sup><sup><span style="font-size:10.0pt">,</span></sup><sup><span lang="VI" style="font-size:
