<td style="width: 56.62%; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; border-left: 1pt solid windowtext; border-bottom: none; border-right: none; background: transparent; padding: 0cm;" width="56%">
<p style="margin-top:6.0pt"><span lang="VI" style="font-size:
  10.0pt">5. Phòng học</span></p>
</td>
<td style="width: 43.38%; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1pt solid windowtext; border-left: 1pt solid windowtext; border-image: initial; border-bottom: none; background: transparent; padding: 0cm;" width="43%">
